<title>AUSTRALIA: AUSTRALIAN RULES-AFL PLAY-OFF RESULTS.</title>
<headline>AUSTRALIAN RULES-AFL PLAY-OFF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Australian Rules</p>
<p>play-off matches at the weekend.</p>
<p>Played Sunday:</p>
<p> North Melbourne  19.17 (131)  Geelong    9.17  (71)</p>
<p>Played Saturday:</p>
<p> West Coast	 18.17 (125)  Carlton   10.10  (70)</p>
<p> Sydney	     13.12  (90)  Hawthorn  12.12  (84)</p>
<p>Played Friday:</p>
<p> Brisbane	   15.11 (101)  Essendon  15.10 (100)</p>
<p>Schedule for second round of play-off matches:</p>
<p>Saturday, September 14</p>
<p>West Coast v Essendon</p>
<p>Brisbane v Carlton</p>
</text>
